1360671", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618235_942829324694004_4374467028023146307_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yHdx7vbxO3EQ7kNvwG0u7hF&_nc_oc=Adp0Xg-_uKxORPYSauxI_sfIn2vzHFIloRHpUORHHO4kgYW2e2EKe1oQSv6nEpIR68U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLfI3W7b3YA0U4x1e48buJyTt4Z4EZ7C3KObOlOXkd0fQ&oe=6AAC0895"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Sky Line - Rope Crossing Game", "keywords": ["RopeCrossing", "RopeGames", "AdventureGames", "ThrillingGames", "CrossingGames"], "long_description": "Sky Line - Rope Crossing Game VR is an immersive adventure that challenges your focus, balance, and nerves of steel. Put yourself in the shoes of a daring rope walker and cross thrilling heights where every step counts.\n\nFace three unique environments, each with its own challenges:\n\nCity: Walk across ropes strung between towering skyscrapers as the bustling metropolis moves far below.\n\nVolcano: Brave the heat and molten dangers while crossing over an erupting volcanic abyss.\n\nForest: Experience the serene yet challenging heights of ropes tied between giant ancient trees.\n\nWith stunning VR visuals and realistic balancing mechanics, every crossing feels like a heart-pounding test of courage. Whether you\u2019re looking for an adrenaline rush or a fun challenge with friends, Sky Line - Rope Crossing Game VR will push you to conquer your fear of heights and master the art of balance.", "short_description": "Step into the thrill of Sky Line - Rope Crossing Game VR! Test your balance and courage as you walk across ropes stretched high above breathtaking environments\u2014City skyscrapers, a fiery Volcano, and a lush Forest. Do you have what it takes to make it to the other side?"}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tu